{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415662","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415662","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1041566201:1":{"text":"우와, 당신은 호건 장군님 대신 기사단의 일상 업무를 맡고 있는 발렌 씨 아니세요?","source_cn":"真巧，这不是替霍根将军暂时代管骑士团日常事务的维伦先生吗。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E8DAEEC6E019A02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041566202:1":{"text":"맞습니다. 그런데 그 긴 호칭은 조금 줄여주시면 좋겠네요.","source_cn":"确实，尽管我挺想反驳你那漫长的前缀的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2F0C7E1273B0BC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041566203:1":{"text":"솔직히 선택할 수 있으면 저는 주점에서 이렇게 편하게 술이나 마시는 쪽이 더 좋거든요.","source_cn":"如果能选的话，我倒是更愿意一直留在这酒馆里，愉快地喝上一杯。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06D37569555E379E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041566204:1":{"text":"...아, 그리고. 만나서 반갑습니다, 이브 양.","source_cn":"——捎带一提，见到你很荣幸，伊芙小姐。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13C39AF6730C3E0B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041566205:1":{"text":"첫 만남의 자기 소개로 어울리는 말은 아닌 것 같네요.","source_cn":"这好像不适合作为寒暄的开场白啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35549BBE45618CA3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041566206:1":{"text":"뭐, 지금까지 저희가 자기 소개를 할 필요는 없었으니까요.","source_cn":"毕竟目前为止，我们也没有寒暄的必要。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4053E52A64D39FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041566207:1":{"text":"그렇다면 이렇게 서로 탐색전을 할 필요도 없지 않을까요?","source_cn":"那我们是不是也没有像这样互相试探的必要呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7935D734870F185","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041566208:1":{"text":"아니요. 필요해요, 이브 양. 당신의 그분께서 직접 모습을 보여주시기 전까지는 저도 그에 맞는 예의를 지켜야 하니까요.","source_cn":"当然有，小姐。在您的那位大人尚未直接对我揭开她——或者...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53DB873A88560B8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041566209:1":{"text":"그렇다면 이런 탐색전과 돌려 말하기가 예의라는 건가요?","source_cn":"所以，你在把刺探和绕弯子作为礼貌？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBBCB7F388C798FC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041566210:1":{"text":"넘겨 짚기나 허세로 가득한 거짓말보다는 훨씬 예의있지 않나요, 이브 양?","source_cn":"比起确切不移的判断和大言不惭的谎言来说，这足够礼貌了，小姐。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF027924FFCA498C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041566211:1":{"text":"적어도 전 아무것도 모르는 척 시간 낭비를 하진 않으니까요.","source_cn":"至少，我没有装作一无所知，伪装成一个浪荡子，说些浪费时...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B1F4D23E68CB721","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041566212:1":{"text":"저희가 지금 하고 있는 게 시간 낭비 아닌가요?","source_cn":"我们现在在说的难道不是浪费时间的废话吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED52FCE4FEB8EC8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:伊芙":{"text":"이브","source":"伊芙","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:维伦":{"text":"발렌","source":"维伦","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":13,"localized_text_count":12,"speaker_count":2}}